WEBVTT

01:42.840 --> 01:44.080
What about these?

01:44.320 --> 01:45.200
Yeah, those are dope too.

01:46.360 --> 01:47.080
Honestly.

01:47.440 --> 01:47.920
Alright,

01:48.160 --> 01:48.640
we'll

01:48.680 --> 01:49.560
take these two.

01:49.600 --> 01:50.080
You got it.

01:50.120 --> 01:50.880
This is for you.

01:51.160 --> 01:52.759
Thanks for being my pack mule today!

01:52.920 --> 01:53.400
Thanks.

02:01.640 --> 02:02.120
All set.

02:07.800 --> 02:09.720
Mom was a major shopaholic.

02:10.360 --> 02:11.720
She'd shop

02:12.200 --> 02:13.920
from dawn

02:14.360 --> 02:15.240
till dusk.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.520
What else

02:18.680 --> 02:20.160
did she like to do

02:20.240 --> 02:20.960
for the holidays?

02:22.200 --> 02:23.800
It changed

02:23.800 --> 02:24.760
every year.

02:25.160 --> 02:26.760
Once, we learned

02:26.840 --> 02:28.320
tie-dyeing in Dali.

02:28.880 --> 02:30.640
Other times, we'd do road trips

02:30.800 --> 02:31.760
or paragliding.

02:33.120 --> 02:34.079
We wanted to

02:34.640 --> 02:36.400
see a big fireworks show...

02:37.440 --> 02:38.560
Unfortunately...

02:42.160 --> 02:42.680
Hey.

02:42.720 --> 02:43.760
Let's go put these bags away.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.760
The day's still young.

02:45.079 --> 02:45.920
Let me

02:46.520 --> 02:47.560
show you some real fun.

02:48.720 --> 02:49.520
Like what?

02:57.600 --> 02:58.240
Keep up!

02:58.800 --> 02:59.560
Dude,

03:00.080 --> 03:01.160
it's freezing,

03:01.160 --> 03:02.400
and you brought me beachcombing?

03:03.560 --> 03:05.760
A real beachgoer doesn't care about the winter.

03:06.360 --> 03:07.880
Well, I care. It's freezing out here.

03:12.080 --> 03:12.760
Oh?

03:20.600 --> 03:21.320
Still cold?

03:22.120 --> 03:22.840
I'll believe it

03:22.840 --> 03:24.280
when I see what you find.

03:25.880 --> 03:26.400
Watch and learn.

03:43.760 --> 03:44.680
Dude,

03:45.520 --> 03:47.120
I got zero!

03:48.720 --> 03:49.360
Don't

03:49.840 --> 03:50.440
give up.

03:50.800 --> 03:51.440
It takes patience.

03:52.160 --> 03:52.720
Keep at it!

03:54.720 --> 03:55.800
Nothing!

03:55.840 --> 03:56.800
I've been looking forever.

03:58.440 --> 03:58.960
Patience.

03:59.240 --> 04:00.160
I'll grab you a crab.

04:01.200 --> 04:02.520
Like it's that easy!

04:09.080 --> 04:09.680
Princess,

04:11.920 --> 04:12.440
your crab!

04:13.040 --> 04:14.320
Wow! You got one!

04:14.840 --> 04:15.600
Let me see!

04:18.360 --> 04:19.040
Drop it in here!

04:19.440 --> 04:21.320
We're having spicy crab tonight!

04:21.760 --> 04:22.840
One won't cut it.

04:24.400 --> 04:25.560
Where's the rest?

04:25.960 --> 04:27.200
Under the big rocks.

04:28.240 --> 04:28.840
Really?

04:32.440 --> 04:34.000
Show-off!

04:34.680 --> 04:35.280
You're

04:35.760 --> 04:36.920
a natural at this.

04:37.760 --> 04:38.600
Grandma used to

04:38.600 --> 04:39.440
bring me here.

04:40.440 --> 04:41.159
Back then,

04:41.920 --> 04:42.720
I was so jealous

04:42.720 --> 04:43.520
of kids

04:43.800 --> 04:45.120
who had their folks with them.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.040
Once, on my birthday,

04:47.600 --> 04:48.720
I threw a tantrum because I wanted to come.

04:49.280 --> 04:50.080
My old man

04:50.080 --> 04:51.000
beat the cr*p out of me.

04:51.240 --> 04:51.960
And then?

04:52.560 --> 04:53.800
Grandma was furious.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.240
She chewed him out,

04:55.440 --> 04:56.840
and brought me here

04:56.960 --> 04:57.560
the next day.

04:58.280 --> 04:59.280
We stayed here until sunset.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.200
That sounds amazing.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.160
Best birthday

05:06.280 --> 05:07.520
of my life.

05:11.440 --> 05:12.680
I wanna catch one!

05:12.800 --> 05:14.080
Got zero so far.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.080
I'll spot'em.

05:17.200 --> 05:17.840
You grab'em!

05:18.960 --> 05:20.280
Let me flip a few rocks.

05:22.720 --> 05:23.600
I bet under here...

05:23.920 --> 05:24.440
Oh, look!

05:24.880 --> 05:25.440
Where?

05:25.560 --> 05:25.920
Right here.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.000
Ready?

05:27.240 --> 05:28.040
Yes, yes!

05:28.160 --> 05:29.200
Get it, quick!

05:29.280 --> 05:30.600
I got it! I actually got it!

05:32.120 --> 05:33.000
Where else?

05:34.159 --> 05:35.040
I think we cleared this spot.

05:35.040 --> 05:35.560
Let's check over here.

05:35.640 --> 05:36.120
Try this one!

05:38.200 --> 05:40.120
We've got a whole feast here!

05:40.640 --> 05:41.800
They're a bit small, though.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.760
Oh, and another one!

05:45.440 --> 05:46.560
We're eating good tonight!

05:48.040 --> 05:48.640
Thank you.

05:48.920 --> 05:49.320
Thanks.

05:49.320 --> 05:49.840
Sent!

05:50.240 --> 05:51.320
A little gift for you.

05:51.520 --> 05:53.200
We're closing up for the year.

05:53.200 --> 05:54.920
There are coupons

05:54.960 --> 05:55.560
inside

05:55.800 --> 05:57.000
for

05:57.080 --> 05:58.200
next time!

05:58.720 --> 05:59.120
Thank you!

05:59.120 --> 06:00.440
Happy New Year!

06:00.520 --> 06:01.560
Enjoy the holidays.

06:01.560 --> 06:02.080
Happy New Year!

06:02.080 --> 06:02.680
Best wishes!

06:02.920 --> 06:03.320
Thanks!

06:03.440 --> 06:04.080
Travel safe!

06:04.080 --> 06:04.560
See ya!

06:13.080 --> 06:13.800
Alrighty!

06:13.880 --> 06:15.520
Pork specialty coming hot!

06:15.960 --> 06:16.720
Enjoy!

06:17.960 --> 06:18.520
Sister!

06:23.000 --> 06:23.600
Er...

06:25.280 --> 06:26.120
Drop by my place

06:26.560 --> 06:27.360
after you close, OK?

06:31.520 --> 06:32.040
Great hand!

06:32.040 --> 06:33.560
Show'em!

06:33.880 --> 06:34.360
Yufen!

06:34.440 --> 06:34.920
Keep it up.

06:34.920 --> 06:35.400
Yufen!

06:35.520 --> 06:36.040
Thanks!

06:36.040 --> 06:36.560
Lanfang!

06:39.040 --> 06:39.840
Take it.

06:39.960 --> 06:40.840
See you

06:41.360 --> 06:42.000
at my place later!

06:42.400 --> 06:43.280
Okeydoke!

06:47.040 --> 06:48.440
New Year, new look!

06:48.600 --> 06:50.080
Perms for everyone!

06:50.280 --> 06:51.720
Even me?

06:52.520 --> 06:53.200
Grandma,

06:53.640 --> 06:55.360
we all deserve to

06:55.360 --> 06:56.320
look hot!

06:56.880 --> 06:58.200
And these cherries

06:58.320 --> 06:59.200
are awesome.

06:59.560 --> 07:01.080
No wonder Qing Ye sent Kyle

07:01.080 --> 07:02.560
to buy some when she got here.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.040
Right?

07:04.040 --> 07:05.440
I got the fancy ones.

07:05.440 --> 07:06.120
The ones with...

07:06.800 --> 07:08.000
all those letters?

07:08.000 --> 07:08.840
Triple J!

07:08.840 --> 07:09.520
Yes, those!

07:09.600 --> 07:10.320
That toots

07:10.560 --> 07:12.760
has taste.

07:13.280 --> 07:15.320
Even at my diner,

07:15.560 --> 07:16.920
she only orders my signature dishes.

07:20.920 --> 07:22.200
Hold on, Lanfang...

07:23.600 --> 07:25.320
You paid us back,

07:25.520 --> 07:26.520
giving us free perms,

07:26.520 --> 07:27.800
and buying fancy cherries?

07:29.520 --> 07:30.440
You're not

07:30.640 --> 07:31.760
in some kinda trouble, right?

07:36.360 --> 07:37.000
Grandma,

07:37.080 --> 07:38.520
what are you smiling at?

07:38.640 --> 07:41.360
Just thinking about how good life is.

07:41.880 --> 07:42.720
Oh yeah?

07:43.640 --> 07:44.440
I

07:45.040 --> 07:45.800
am

07:46.240 --> 07:48.680
finally debt-free!

07:49.560 --> 07:51.120
The salon is

07:51.440 --> 07:53.240
officially all mine.

07:53.520 --> 07:54.560
No more loans,

07:54.640 --> 07:56.400
no more stress!

07:57.040 --> 07:58.040
Wait, shut up.

07:58.120 --> 07:59.760
Grandma, is she serious?

07:59.840 --> 08:00.640
100%!

08:01.040 --> 08:03.040
We are officially outta the red.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.800
Lanfang, oh my god!

08:04.920 --> 08:06.320
That is amazing!

08:06.320 --> 08:07.120
I know, right?

08:07.320 --> 08:08.040
I literally thought

08:08.040 --> 08:09.240
you were dying.

08:09.280 --> 08:10.120
Scared the hell out of me!

08:10.880 --> 08:12.760
Why would I be dying?

08:13.400 --> 08:14.280
I've just

08:15.240 --> 08:16.040
been

08:17.120 --> 08:18.360
pinching pennies

08:18.360 --> 08:19.720
for so long.

08:19.920 --> 08:21.240
For once, I wanted to

08:21.440 --> 08:22.080
splurge!

08:22.280 --> 08:22.960
Tell us,

08:23.320 --> 08:25.120
what does it

08:25.360 --> 08:26.520
feel like?

08:26.880 --> 08:29.600
Like I'm floating.

08:30.200 --> 08:31.000
Like I'm

08:31.640 --> 08:32.520
on cloud nine.

08:33.720 --> 08:34.880
It's the

08:34.880 --> 08:35.840
ultimate weight

08:35.919 --> 08:36.880
off your shoulders.

08:37.919 --> 08:38.880
Light at

08:39.480 --> 08:41.360
the end of the tunnel.

08:41.760 --> 08:42.200
Exactly that.

08:42.200 --> 08:42.799
I hear you, babe.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.080
I know you do.

08:46.160 --> 08:46.600
But seriously...

08:46.880 --> 08:47.640
thanks for

08:47.720 --> 08:48.680
always

08:48.680 --> 08:49.440
having my back!

08:49.880 --> 08:50.840
Oh, please.

08:50.880 --> 08:51.880
Spare me the tears, woman!

08:51.960 --> 08:53.800
We're practically sisters.

08:54.320 --> 08:55.800
That's what sisters do.

08:55.800 --> 08:56.440
Always.

08:58.160 --> 08:59.080
You guys

08:59.680 --> 09:00.880
know my history.

09:01.080 --> 09:02.600
Marrying Guodong

09:02.600 --> 09:04.760
while pregnant...

09:05.640 --> 09:06.320
talk about

09:06.520 --> 09:07.680
a

09:07.760 --> 09:08.520
trainwreck.

09:08.840 --> 09:09.960
I spent so many nights crying,

09:10.720 --> 09:11.720
wondering why

09:11.720 --> 09:12.800
God kept testing me.

09:13.520 --> 09:14.760
I felt so incredibly

09:14.760 --> 09:15.880
hopeless.

09:16.960 --> 09:17.840
I thought

09:18.040 --> 09:19.000
my life was

09:19.000 --> 09:20.440
a dead end.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.000
But this year, it finally clicked.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.400
Everyone is

09:25.840 --> 09:26.520
fighting

09:27.120 --> 09:29.160
their own

09:29.600 --> 09:31.000
battle.

09:32.360 --> 09:33.160
If you

09:34.880 --> 09:35.640
get stuck,

09:36.280 --> 09:37.240
it's a scar.

09:38.000 --> 09:39.040
If you get through,

09:40.360 --> 09:41.520
it's just a lesson.

09:43.280 --> 09:44.120
Amen, sister!

09:44.440 --> 09:45.640
You're a total badass!

09:45.960 --> 09:47.840
The worst is behind you.

09:48.400 --> 09:49.600
Wu is going to

09:49.640 --> 09:50.320
get into

09:50.320 --> 09:51.520
a great college,

09:51.640 --> 09:52.440
you and Grandma

09:52.520 --> 09:53.960
can live like queens!

09:54.360 --> 09:54.920
D*mn straight!

09:55.760 --> 09:57.600
I'm one foot in the grave anyway.

09:57.920 --> 09:58.680
I just want

09:58.680 --> 10:00.760
my babies to be happy.

10:01.720 --> 10:02.840
Mom, shut up!

10:02.840 --> 10:03.920
You're gonna outlive all of us!

10:04.320 --> 10:04.880
D*mn right!

10:04.880 --> 10:05.360
Grandma,

10:05.400 --> 10:06.040
take that back!

10:06.040 --> 10:06.680
Do-over!

10:06.680 --> 10:07.440
Unsay it!

10:07.840 --> 10:10.680
I'll live a long, long life

10:10.840 --> 10:12.000
and watch you all be happy!

10:12.120 --> 10:12.920
Yay!

10:12.920 --> 10:13.760
Much better!

10:14.280 --> 10:15.320
Yeah!

10:15.640 --> 10:17.000
Take a shot, win a prize!

10:17.440 --> 10:18.000
How much?

10:18.520 --> 10:19.320
30 a game!

10:20.840 --> 10:21.280
C'mon!

10:21.520 --> 10:22.400
"Sniper King?"

10:23.520 --> 10:24.560
Why does everyone

10:24.560 --> 10:25.720
at the shop

10:25.880 --> 10:26.560
call you that?

10:27.520 --> 10:28.120
Wanna see?

10:30.240 --> 10:30.680
Come!

10:34.320 --> 10:35.880
Shoot to win! Give it a try!

10:36.080 --> 10:37.520
What are we aiming for?

10:38.560 --> 10:39.240
You tell me.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.520
That

10:41.800 --> 10:42.360
baby dragon?

10:43.120 --> 10:44.440
Please.

10:45.040 --> 10:46.400
I want the grand prize!

10:46.560 --> 10:47.520
The grill pan.

10:47.880 --> 10:48.760
I want us

10:48.760 --> 10:49.920
to have BBQ on cold nights.

10:49.960 --> 10:50.760
It'll be cozy!

10:51.720 --> 10:52.600
Piece of cake!

10:54.160 --> 10:55.760
Listen to you.

10:55.920 --> 10:57.160
Aren't we cocky today?

10:57.240 --> 10:58.600
He's a real marksman, miss!

10:58.640 --> 10:59.160
Hey.

10:59.640 --> 11:00.480
Wanna play, man?

11:00.520 --> 11:01.120
How much?

11:01.280 --> 11:02.160
30 a round.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.080
Prizes for

11:04.440 --> 11:05.520
every hit.

11:06.000 --> 11:06.680
Clear the board,

11:06.680 --> 11:07.280
and you take home the pan!

11:07.560 --> 11:08.440
Sure. Let's do it.

11:08.960 --> 11:09.440
Oorah!

11:11.760 --> 11:13.160
Such a poser!

11:14.520 --> 11:15.760
Watch and learn.

11:35.960 --> 11:36.800
Wow!

11:37.160 --> 11:37.880
Great shot, kid!

11:38.280 --> 11:38.720
Alright,

11:39.240 --> 11:40.040
here's

11:40.440 --> 11:41.000
the grand prize!

11:41.040 --> 11:41.600
Thanks.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.160
That was

11:43.200 --> 11:43.920
pure luck.

11:44.240 --> 11:45.000
Luck?

11:45.720 --> 11:46.600
Pick another one.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.240
Here you go.

11:49.320 --> 11:49.840
It's yours.

11:51.280 --> 11:52.320
I want the

11:52.800 --> 11:53.520
baby dragon!

11:54.920 --> 11:55.400
OK.

11:56.560 --> 11:57.000
Hey,

11:57.560 --> 11:58.720
can I shoot two at once?

11:59.000 --> 11:59.520
Two?

12:01.000 --> 12:01.520
Please?

12:01.520 --> 12:02.760
Uh, sure.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.440
Unbelievable, man!

12:35.680 --> 12:37.520
You're "The Sniper King," man!

12:37.680 --> 12:39.120
Never seen anything like it!

12:40.640 --> 12:41.120
So...

12:41.120 --> 12:42.120
I'll take the dragon.

12:42.240 --> 12:42.840
The baby dragon?

12:43.160 --> 12:44.240
All yours, boss!

12:46.440 --> 12:47.120
Still luck?

12:48.040 --> 12:48.640
I guess not.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.400
Now you know how I got the title.

12:52.160 --> 12:52.720
Whatever, hotshot.

12:54.120 --> 12:54.920
Your dragon!

12:54.960 --> 12:55.600
Thanks.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.160
Have a good one!

12:56.320 --> 12:56.760
Here.

12:58.000 --> 12:58.720
What's next?

12:59.440 --> 13:00.120
Um...

13:00.120 --> 13:00.680
Buddy,

13:01.240 --> 13:02.520
go easy on me.

13:02.760 --> 13:04.000
Gotta make a living here.

13:04.280 --> 13:04.920
Pretty, please...

13:05.520 --> 13:06.040
Alright.

13:06.440 --> 13:07.120
Thanks, man.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.160
Bless you!

13:08.200 --> 13:08.880
Happy New Year!

13:09.640 --> 13:10.320
Thanks! Same to you!

13:21.800 --> 13:22.960
So good!

13:24.240 --> 13:25.720
Fry the lotus roots

13:25.720 --> 13:26.880
before we do the fish.

13:27.000 --> 13:27.880
You got it, Mom!

13:27.880 --> 13:29.520
Otherwise, the oil gets fishy.

13:29.760 --> 13:30.600
Understood!

13:32.200 --> 13:33.520
Golden brown!

13:34.200 --> 13:35.800
To a wealthy new year!

13:36.320 --> 13:37.600
Fortune is coming!

13:37.680 --> 13:38.880
Mom, you're getting sweeter

13:38.880 --> 13:40.040
by the day.

13:40.160 --> 13:41.600
I love it.

13:43.040 --> 13:44.000
How do these look?

13:44.040 --> 13:44.840
Keep turning it.

13:44.840 --> 13:45.360
G,

13:45.440 --> 13:46.040
does this look like your ear?

13:48.680 --> 13:49.200
Cute, right?

13:49.280 --> 13:50.760
Ah, so his big ears

13:50.800 --> 13:52.240
are made of dumplings!

13:52.280 --> 13:53.520
Obviously!

13:53.560 --> 13:54.720
Still too small.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.720
Roll it out.

13:57.720 --> 13:59.120
Hey, not bad!

14:00.240 --> 14:01.040
This one is good.

14:01.280 --> 14:02.080
Right?

14:02.200 --> 14:02.840
Auntie,

14:03.000 --> 14:03.720
here,

14:03.720 --> 14:04.560
let me make one!

14:04.640 --> 14:05.560
Add more filling.

14:06.760 --> 14:07.320
Kiddo,

14:07.400 --> 14:08.600
you’re doing great!

14:47.560 --> 14:48.440
Welcome!

14:56.080 --> 14:56.520
Ping!

14:58.520 --> 14:59.200
I'm back.

14:59.680 --> 15:00.240
I know.

15:00.520 --> 15:01.720
Officer Xu told me.

15:05.360 --> 15:06.280
You're alone?

15:06.320 --> 15:06.840
Where's Uncle?

15:07.520 --> 15:08.560
They went on a trip.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.280
And you didn't join them?

15:11.360 --> 15:12.160
Why should I?

15:12.160 --> 15:13.280
They are family.

15:17.880 --> 15:18.600
Fan,

15:19.360 --> 15:20.720
it's New Year's Eve.

15:21.040 --> 15:22.360
I got your favorites.

15:22.880 --> 15:23.600
Let's

15:24.040 --> 15:25.160
have a reunion dinner.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.160
Great!

15:32.520 --> 15:33.120
Easy.

15:35.880 --> 15:36.320
Here.

15:38.560 --> 15:39.200
There you go!

15:59.120 --> 15:59.840
Sorry,

16:00.880 --> 16:01.600
I was so hot-headed.

16:02.760 --> 16:03.680
I shouldn't have left you

16:03.680 --> 16:04.520
to struggle like this.

16:06.040 --> 16:06.920
These years...

16:08.280 --> 16:08.960
you've had it so rough.

16:09.920 --> 16:10.880
Stop it.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.000
This is actually

16:12.000 --> 16:13.040
the best New Year I've ever had.

16:18.560 --> 16:19.320
Have a dumpling.

16:32.840 --> 16:33.760
Look! That's beautiful!

16:36.720 --> 16:37.640
Grandma!

16:37.680 --> 16:38.440
My boy!

16:47.120 --> 16:48.240
Fire in the hole!

16:48.360 --> 16:48.960
There you go!

16:51.400 --> 16:52.640
Whoa!

17:13.040 --> 17:14.400
Great job, son!

17:14.760 --> 17:16.200
Cheers! Happy New Year!

17:16.200 --> 17:17.200
Happy New Year!

