Auntie!

32:25.680 --> 32:27.440
Lanfang, are you crazy!

32:27.520 --> 32:28.240
Calm down!

32:28.960 --> 32:30.400
Grandma is still in there!

32:30.440 --> 32:31.720
Your grandma...

32:31.720 --> 32:32.360
Grandma...

32:33.440 --> 32:34.200
Wu! No!

32:36.560 --> 32:37.200
Wu!

32:37.240 --> 32:37.840
Wu!

32:38.760 --> 32:39.440
Xing Wu!

32:39.640 --> 32:40.240
Son!

32:40.360 --> 32:40.840
Mom!

32:41.080 --> 32:42.400
How did this happen?

32:42.440 --> 32:42.920
Fire...

32:43.120 --> 32:43.840
Do something!

32:44.080 --> 32:45.440
Xing Wu went in!

32:45.600 --> 32:46.120
Get some water!

32:46.120 --> 32:47.560
Come on!

32:54.640 --> 32:55.160
Grandma!

32:55.400 --> 32:57.680
Help! Help!

32:58.160 --> 33:00.680
Fire!

33:01.400 --> 33:02.000
Grandma!

33:03.680 --> 33:05.520
Sweetie, help!

33:06.800 --> 33:07.280
Grandma!

33:07.280 --> 33:08.880
Wu!

33:08.880 --> 33:09.320
I'm here.

33:09.360 --> 33:10.440
Be careful, Kyle!

33:11.640 --> 33:12.520
Watch out, son!

33:12.520 --> 33:13.360
Xing Wu!

33:13.960 --> 33:14.800
Oh god...

33:14.920 --> 33:15.920
They'll be OK.

33:16.200 --> 33:16.800
I've got you.

33:17.040 --> 33:17.960
I'm here, Grandma!

33:19.560 --> 33:20.400
OK.

33:20.600 --> 33:21.000
OK.

33:21.200 --> 33:21.920
Get on my back.

33:22.520 --> 33:23.000
Come on!

33:23.000 --> 33:23.560
OK...

33:27.880 --> 33:29.200
They'll make it...

33:29.200 --> 33:30.120
Auntie...

33:32.680 --> 33:33.400
I've got you!

33:41.400 --> 33:42.200
Hold tight, Grandma!

33:43.680 --> 33:44.880
OK...

33:45.440 --> 33:45.920
Let's go.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.800
Fire trucks!

33:57.800 --> 33:58.560
Over here!

33:59.280 --> 34:00.000
Back up!

34:00.160 --> 34:00.800
All of you, back!

34:03.240 --> 34:04.200
Watch out!

34:10.400 --> 34:11.719
Chemicals inside!

34:11.960 --> 34:13.000
Toxic fumes!

34:13.360 --> 34:14.360
Step back!

34:14.600 --> 34:15.040
Clear the area!

34:15.040 --> 34:16.040
They're trapped inside!

34:16.199 --> 34:17.840
My boy is in there!

34:17.840 --> 34:19.520
My mom too!

34:19.560 --> 34:20.560
Please!

34:21.159 --> 34:22.520
Move! Go to the back!

34:38.199 --> 34:39.880
Wu! What now?

34:45.600 --> 34:46.120
Hold tight,

34:46.520 --> 34:47.360
Grandma!

34:47.760 --> 34:48.360
Just hold on!

34:50.360 --> 34:51.120
Watch it,

34:51.159 --> 34:51.639
sweetie.

34:59.600 --> 35:00.160
Mom!

35:01.120 --> 35:01.640
Mom!

35:01.800 --> 35:03.320
Lanfang...

35:04.000 --> 35:04.600
Xing Wu!

35:05.560 --> 35:08.320
Dude, you're fine!

35:08.520 --> 35:09.560
Mom!

35:09.840 --> 35:10.360
Wu...

35:10.360 --> 35:11.120
- I'm fine.
- Grandma...

35:11.520 --> 35:12.240
Check Grandma.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.120
You OK?

35:13.240 --> 35:14.160
Do we need an ambulance?

35:14.320 --> 35:15.000
That was too close...

35:15.080 --> 35:15.520
I'm OK!

35:15.720 --> 35:17.160
I'm fine...

35:17.400 --> 35:18.000
Fine...

35:18.760 --> 35:19.320
Qing Ye,

35:19.840 --> 35:20.520
your laptop...

35:22.360 --> 35:23.080
C'mon,

35:23.120 --> 35:23.840
let's go to my place.

35:23.920 --> 35:25.320
OK.

35:25.320 --> 35:26.240
Move, move.

35:26.520 --> 35:27.040
Go.

35:27.240 --> 35:27.680
Easy, easy.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.280
Watch your step!

35:32.520 --> 35:33.320
Easy.

35:33.680 --> 35:34.320
Easy.

35:36.360 --> 35:37.000
It's over,

35:37.320 --> 35:37.840
Grandma.

35:38.240 --> 35:38.720
I'm here.

35:39.160 --> 35:40.400
Don worry.

35:40.720 --> 35:41.680
The salon is gone,

35:42.120 --> 35:42.920
but we're all here.

35:44.720 --> 35:45.280
Grandma,

35:45.800 --> 35:46.520
cold?

35:47.000 --> 35:48.240
Take my jacket.

35:48.600 --> 35:49.280
Wear mine.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.240
Yours is soaked.

35:51.000 --> 35:51.640
OK.

35:51.720 --> 35:52.640
I'm fine, really.

35:52.640 --> 35:53.320
It's OK, Mom...

35:53.440 --> 35:54.920
We're safe now.

35:55.000 --> 35:55.600
Grandma, here.

35:56.040 --> 35:56.640
It's over...

35:56.920 --> 35:57.720
Put this on.

35:58.680 --> 35:59.320
Get some water

35:59.920 --> 36:00.640
in you.

36:01.200 --> 36:02.080
Grandma, drink.

36:02.840 --> 36:03.600
You first.

36:04.360 --> 36:05.560
Please, just drink!

36:08.520 --> 36:09.320
You're safe now.

36:12.120 --> 36:13.320
Here, Wu.

36:13.920 --> 36:14.520
Thanks,

36:14.880 --> 36:15.520
appreciate it.

36:18.520 --> 36:19.080
Wu...

36:21.520 --> 36:22.680
Your wrist...

36:24.000 --> 36:25.640
Oh my god, Xing Wu...

36:26.000 --> 36:27.000
You're hurt...

36:28.800 --> 36:29.400
I'm fine,

36:30.280 --> 36:31.040
really.

36:31.880 --> 36:32.760
We

36:33.280 --> 36:34.440
slipped out

36:34.440 --> 36:35.320
the back yard.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.600
Lucky her room had a back door,

36:38.120 --> 36:38.760
or we'd be

36:38.760 --> 36:39.400
in real trouble.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.680
Thank god...

36:41.280 --> 36:42.200
Yeah. Thank god.

36:43.040 --> 36:43.680
Grandma,

36:44.280 --> 36:45.080
thank god!

36:46.880 --> 36:47.800
We're all here.

37:06.200 --> 37:06.720
How is it?

37:07.440 --> 37:08.600
It's under control.

37:09.200 --> 37:10.400
Chemical hazard inside.

37:10.520 --> 37:11.920
Stay out.

37:12.000 --> 37:13.440
We'll keep you updated.

37:13.600 --> 37:14.200
OK.

37:14.240 --> 37:15.000
Thank you.

37:15.160 --> 37:15.800
Thank you so much!

37:21.640 --> 37:22.520
The fire is out.

37:23.520 --> 37:24.080
Grandma.

37:24.600 --> 37:25.640
It's all good.

37:28.280 --> 37:28.920
Lanfang,

37:29.320 --> 37:31.080
you're staying with me tonight.

37:31.520 --> 37:32.520
Big G

37:32.520 --> 37:34.080
is setting up the room.

37:35.840 --> 37:37.440
And the kids are staying with me!

37:37.760 --> 37:38.320
Wu,

37:38.400 --> 37:39.440
did Kyle tell you?

37:40.960 --> 37:41.520
Yeah.

37:42.320 --> 37:42.760
Good.

37:42.800 --> 37:43.840
We have plenty of space.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.400
Got everything

37:45.400 --> 37:46.200
ready.

37:46.720 --> 37:47.920
I kicked my husband out

37:48.040 --> 37:49.080
to a buddy's

37:49.200 --> 37:49.800
so you guys

37:49.800 --> 37:50.600
could have more space.

37:51.000 --> 37:51.760
Thanks.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.680
Thanks for taking care of Mom and Grandma.

37:55.120 --> 37:56.840
We won't stay long.

37:57.720 --> 37:59.240
Come on!

37:59.240 --> 38:00.680
That's what neighbors

38:00.760 --> 38:01.640
are for!

38:02.760 --> 38:03.960
Lanfang, relax.

38:04.080 --> 38:04.920
We are right here with you.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.040
It's alright, Grandma.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.000
Thank you, everyone.

38:07.000 --> 38:07.760
No problem.

38:07.880 --> 38:08.600
Auntie,

38:10.560 --> 38:12.040
you and Grandma

38:12.040 --> 38:13.280
get some rest.

38:13.720 --> 38:14.720
We'll deal with

38:15.320 --> 38:16.920
everything tomorrow.

38:17.720 --> 38:18.160
Yeah.

38:19.520 --> 38:20.480
She's right.

38:31.120 --> 38:31.640
Crash here,

38:31.840 --> 38:32.720
guys.

38:33.320 --> 38:34.520
Make yourselves

38:34.720 --> 38:35.560
at home.

38:36.840 --> 38:37.240
Oh,

38:37.440 --> 38:38.440
Mom put some toiletries together.

38:38.680 --> 38:39.680
Just holler if you need anything.

38:39.840 --> 38:40.400
Thanks,

38:40.840 --> 38:41.520
bro.

38:42.720 --> 38:43.400
I'll head down.

38:43.560 --> 38:44.120
OK.

38:51.920 --> 38:52.560
Towels,

38:52.640 --> 38:54.240
toiletries,

38:54.760 --> 38:55.800
slippers...

38:56.080 --> 38:56.720
everything is new.

38:57.520 --> 38:58.720
You're in that room tonight.

38:59.680 --> 39:01.000
Bathroom is by the stairs.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.200
Hot water is ready.

39:02.520 --> 39:03.400
Left is hot,

39:03.400 --> 39:04.240
right is cold.

39:06.080 --> 39:06.600
Yufen

39:06.600 --> 39:07.800
packed some clothes.

39:07.840 --> 39:08.720
I'll bring them up later.

39:09.640 --> 39:10.600
Anything else...

39:11.520 --> 39:12.400
Thank you.

39:17.440 --> 39:17.960
OK.

39:20.640 --> 39:21.120
Here.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.320
Just relax tonight.

39:24.080 --> 39:25.040
Take a hot shower

39:25.320 --> 39:26.160
and rest.

39:33.360 --> 39:34.160
I'll go wash up.

39:50.600 --> 39:51.880
Here, Mom.

39:52.640 --> 39:53.920
OK.

39:56.000 --> 39:56.600
Good temp?

39:58.560 --> 39:59.200
Relax.

40:06.600 --> 40:07.080
Grandma,

40:07.280 --> 40:08.280
brought a quilt

40:08.320 --> 40:09.400
for the cold.

40:09.680 --> 40:10.760
I'll redo

40:10.800 --> 40:11.840
the bedsheets in a second.

40:12.560 --> 40:14.600
Thanks for everything!

40:14.920 --> 40:15.800
Come on.

40:16.240 --> 40:18.080
Make yourself at home.

40:18.960 --> 40:20.280
My husband and son are staying

40:20.400 --> 40:21.360
at my dad's.

40:22.720 --> 40:23.960
C'mon, I'll do it.

40:24.160 --> 40:24.960
Nah,

40:25.000 --> 40:25.400
seriously,

40:25.400 --> 40:26.040
stay with Grandma!

40:26.240 --> 40:28.080
You guys have helped enough.

40:28.440 --> 40:29.200
Get some rest.

40:29.880 --> 40:30.560
It's fine.

40:30.560 --> 40:31.160
You're exhausted.

40:31.200 --> 40:31.800
Stay with Grandma.

40:32.240 --> 40:33.800
Two pairs of hands

40:33.960 --> 40:35.520
are faster!

40:36.120 --> 40:36.520
Come on,

40:36.680 --> 40:37.080
let's go.

40:37.520 --> 40:38.000
I'll lend a hand.

40:41.120 --> 40:42.040
Here, Mom.

40:43.000 --> 40:43.800
It's cool.

40:44.120 --> 40:44.760
Let them help.

40:45.080 --> 40:45.520
OK.

40:45.840 --> 40:47.080
Lift your chin.

40:59.560 --> 41:00.080
[Hello,]

41:00.200 --> 41:01.800
[the line is busy...]

41:06.040 --> 41:07.760
[Mom, how is Grandma?]

41:08.440 --> 41:09.560
[We should]

41:09.560 --> 41:10.760
[get her checked]

41:12.120 --> 41:13.240
[tomorrow.]

41:47.480 --> 41:48.080
Qing Ye?

41:49.760 --> 41:50.360
Come in.

41:55.440 --> 41:57.000
Brought you this.

41:58.320 --> 41:59.040
Thanks.

42:01.160 --> 42:02.720
It's Kyle's charger.

42:03.120 --> 42:03.800
See

42:04.560 --> 42:05.560
if the laptop works.

42:09.200 --> 42:10.320
It was a life-and-death moment.

42:10.320 --> 42:11.640
Why did you save my laptop?

42:14.120 --> 42:15.240
It's important,

42:15.520 --> 42:16.120
right?

42:16.400 --> 42:17.760
You are way more important!

42:23.120 --> 42:23.880
Just try it.

42:29.440 --> 42:31.320
Your hand is blistered.

42:35.240 --> 42:36.080
It's fine.

42:36.920 --> 42:37.600
Don't worry.

42:40.040 --> 42:41.360
You need burn cream.

42:42.400 --> 42:43.960
I'll go get some...

43:08.040 --> 43:08.600
Trust me,

43:08.600 --> 43:09.960
I'm fine.

43:10.400 --> 43:11.360
I heal fast.

43:15.440 --> 43:16.200
Get some rest.

43:19.240 --> 43:20.080
Xing Wu...

43:24.880 --> 43:26.160
Are you sure you're OK?

43:32.760 --> 43:33.320
Seriously,

43:33.880 --> 43:34.920
I'm fine.

43:35.680 --> 43:37.520
I'll just put some ice pops

43:37.520 --> 43:38.520
on it.

43:39.120 --> 43:40.000
It'll soothe the burn.
